{"title":"Career Roadmap: Computational Designer","role":"Computational Designer","summary":"A Computational Designer uses programming, algorithms, parametric modelling, geometry, simulation, optimization, and digital fabrication to solve complex architectural and design problems.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Arch"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["ID","Level","Discipline","Degree","Specialization","Target Career"],"rows":[[{"text":"615"},{"text":"UG"},{"text":"Architecture, Planning & Design"},{"text":"B.Arch (Bachelor of Architecture)"},{"text":"Digital Architecture / Computational Design"},{"text":"Computational Designer"}]]}]},{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Computational Designer uses programming, algorithms, parametric modelling, geometry, simulation, optimization, and digital fabrication to solve complex architectural and design problems."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architecture","Design","Mathematics","Programming","Digital Fabrication","Data"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A Computational Designer may work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parametric architecture"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Complex geometries"},{"text":"Building optimization"},{"text":"Facade design"},{"text":"Environmental analysis"},{"text":"Structural geometry"},{"text":"Urban-scale modelling"},{"text":"BIM automation"},{"text":"Digital fabrication"},{"text":"AI-assisted design"},{"text":"Design technology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Arch graduate, this is a strong future-oriented pathway because architectural knowledge provides the design and building context, while computational skills enable automation and optimization."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Parametric modelling, Grasshopper, Rhino, scripting, BIM, computational design projects"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Computational Designer / Parametric Designer / Design Technology Specialist"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Senior Computational Designer / Computational Design Lead / Design Technology Lead"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Design Technology Director / Computational Design Principal / Digital Practice Founder"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The field is expanding from simple parametric modelling toward generative design, AI, simulation, optimization, digital twins, robotics, and automated fabrication."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Arch","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design + Computational Thinking"},{"type":"p","text":"Build fundamentals in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architectural design"},{"text":"Geometry"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Pattern"},{"text":"Spatial relationships"},{"text":"Basic mathematics"},{"text":"Logical thinking"},{"text":"Design systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino basics"},{"text":"Grasshopper basics"},{"text":"Visual programming concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start thinking in terms of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Input","Rule","Process","Output"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Parametric Modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Grasshopper"},{"text":"NURBS"},{"text":"Curves"},{"text":"Surfaces"},{"text":"Meshes"},{"text":"Transformations"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"Parametric relationships"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn Grasshopper concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lists"},{"text":"Trees"},{"text":"Loops"},{"text":"Data matching"},{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Attractors"},{"text":"Domains"},{"text":"Expressions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Scripting + Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Add programming:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"C#"},{"text":"JavaScript basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Algorithmic design"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Environmental simulation"},{"text":"Geometry processing"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Integrate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Grasshopper","Python","Environmental Analysis"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Professional Computational Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Complex building geometry"},{"text":"Facade optimization"},{"text":"Structural geometry"},{"text":"BIM automation"},{"text":"Design-to-fabrication"},{"text":"Environmental optimization"},{"text":"Large-scale parametric systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how computational workflows interact with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Structural engineering"},{"text":"MEP"},{"text":"Fabrication"},{"text":"Construction"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 5 — Advanced Digital Architecture"},{"type":"p","text":"Use the thesis/project to explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-generated architecture"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Robotic fabrication"},{"text":"Parametric facades"},{"text":"Urban computational modelling"},{"text":"Climate-responsive computational design"},{"text":"Digital twins"},{"text":"Algorithmic urbanism"}]}]},{"heading":"Core Technical Knowledge","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"A. Computational Geometry"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Points"},{"text":"Vectors"},{"text":"Curves"},{"text":"Surfaces"},{"text":"Meshes"},{"text":"Transformations"},{"text":"Intersections"},{"text":"Boolean operations"},{"text":"Coordinate systems"},{"text":"NURBS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"B. Parametric Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how to create relationships between design parameters."},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Building Width","Facade Module","Window Size","Solar Exposure","Daylight","Energy Performance"]},{"type":"p","text":"Changing one variable should automatically update the dependent geometry."},{"type":"h","text":"C. Algorithmic Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to translate design logic into algorithms."},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Site Boundary","Generate Grid","Apply Design Rules","Generate Geometry","Evaluate Performance","Optimize","Final Design"]},{"type":"h","text":"D. Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Single-objective optimization"},{"text":"Multi-objective optimization"},{"text":"Constraint-based design"},{"text":"Genetic algorithms"},{"text":"Evolutionary optimization"},{"text":"Design-space exploration"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential optimization parameters include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Solar exposure"},{"text":"Structure"},{"text":"Material quantity"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Carbon"},{"text":"Views"},{"text":"Density"}]}]},{"heading":"Programming Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"h","text":"Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Variables"},{"text":"Functions"},{"text":"Loops"},{"text":"Data structures"},{"text":"Object-oriented programming basics"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Matplotlib"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Architecture-Specific Python"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino Python"},{"text":"Grasshopper Python"},{"text":"RhinoCommon concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"p","text":"Later explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"C#"},{"text":"JavaScript"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Computer vision"},{"text":"The objective isn't to become a traditional software engineer."},{"text":"The objective is to become an architect who can automate, analyze, generate, and optimize design workflows."}]}]},{"heading":"Tools & Software","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Grasshopper"},{"text":"AutoCAD"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"SketchUp"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Computational Design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grasshopper"},{"text":"Dynamo"},{"text":"Rhino.Inside.Revit"},{"text":"Ladybug Tools"},{"text":"Honeybee"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Simulation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EnergyPlus"},{"text":"OpenStudio"},{"text":"Radiance"},{"text":"ClimateStudio"},{"text":"Structural-analysis tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"VS Code"},{"text":"Jupyter"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Visualization"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enscape"},{"text":"V-Ray"},{"text":"Twinmotion"},{"text":"Blender"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fabrication"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CNC"},{"text":"Laser cutting"},{"text":"3D printing"},{"text":"Robotic fabrication"}]}]},{"heading":"Five Recommended UG Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Parametric Facade Generator"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Grasshopper system where users can control:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building dimensions"},{"text":"Window size"},{"text":"Module spacing"},{"text":"Shading depth"},{"text":"Orientation"},{"text":"The system automatically generates facade variations."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Solar-Optimized Building"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a parametric building whose geometry responds to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar radiation"},{"text":"Orientation"},{"text":"Shading"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Develop multiple design alternatives and compare their performance."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Generative Floor-Plan System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a system that generates different floor-plan options based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site boundary"},{"text":"Room requirements"},{"text":"Area constraints"},{"text":"Adjacencies"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"This demonstrates computational thinking beyond simple 3D modelling."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Parametric Urban Block"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a computational urban model that generates variations based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site area"},{"text":"Building height"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Road network"},{"text":"Open space"},{"text":"Sunlight"},{"text":"Floor-area ratio"},{"text":"Evaluate different urban configurations."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Design-to-Fabrication Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a parametric architectural component such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Facade panel"},{"text":"Pavilion"},{"text":"Furniture"},{"text":"Canopy"},{"text":"Structural shell"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Concept","Parametric Model","Optimization","Fabrication Files","CNC / Laser / 3D Printing","Physical Prototype"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is particularly valuable in a computational-design portfolio."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target firms with dedicated:"},{"type":"h","text":"Computational Design Teams"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parametric architecture"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Algorithmic modelling"},{"text":"Design technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Architecture Technology Teams"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"BIM automation"},{"text":"Revit scripting"},{"text":"Dynamo"},{"text":"Rhino.Inside.Revit"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Façade Engineering Firms"},{"type":"p","text":"Excellent for learning:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parametric facades"},{"text":"Geometry"},{"text":"Environmental optimization"},{"text":"Fabrication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Fabrication Labs"},{"type":"p","text":"Gain exposure to:"},{"t