 training in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Grasshopper"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Revit"},{"text":"Dynamo"},{"text":"Rhino.Inside.Revit"},{"text":"Ladybug Tools"},{"text":"Environmental simulation"},{"text":"Generative design"},{"text":"Digital fabrication"},{"text":"For this career, portfolio projects are generally more important than collecting certificates."}]},{"type":"p","text":"A recruiter should be able to see:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Algorithm","Computational Workflow","Design Alternatives","Optimization","Final Solution"]}]},{"heading":"PG Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A master's degree is not mandatory for entering computational design, but it can be highly valuable for advanced research and design-technology roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Options"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Arch – Digital Architecture"},{"text":"M.Arch – Computational Design"},{"text":"M.Arch – Advanced Architectural Design"},{"text":"M.Arch – Design Technology"},{"text":"Master's in Computational Design"},{"text":"Master's in Architectural Computation"},{"text":"Master's in Digital Fabrication"},{"text":"Master's in Design Technology"},{"text":"Master's in Building Performance"},{"text":"Master's in Digital Architecture"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology-Oriented Options"},{"type":"p","text":"For students who want a stronger technical direction:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computational Science"},{"text":"Data Science"},{"text":"Artificial Intelligence"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"Computer Science"},{"text":"These are particularly useful for careers moving toward AI + architecture, robotics, simulation, or AEC technology."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Parametric Designer"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"Grasshopper"},{"text":"Complex geometry"},{"text":"Parametric systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":