er","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"AI + Computational Design"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly complement parametric workflows through:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design-option generation"},{"text":"Performance prediction"},{"text":"Pattern recognition"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"Image-to-geometry workflows"},{"text":"Generative architectural systems"},{"text":"The valuable skill will not be simply “using AI to create images.”"}]},{"type":"p","text":"It will be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["AI","Geometry","Algorithms","Building Knowledge","Performance Evaluation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Generative Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Generative systems can automatically produce thousands of design alternatives and evaluate them against:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Carbon"},{"text":"Structure"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Views"},{"text":"Program requirements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Twins"},{"type":"p","text":"Computational designers will increasingly connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BIM","Sensors","Simulation","Real-Time Data"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"to improve building performance throughout the building lifecycle."},{"type":"h","text":"Robotics"},{"type":"p","text":"Robotic systems can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Robotic construction"},{"text":"Robotic fabrication"},{"text":"Automated assembly"},{"text":"3D printing"},{"text":"CNC fabrication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Fabrication"},{"type":"p","text":"The workflow increasingly becomes:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Algorithm","Parametric Geometry","Optimization","Fabrication Data","Machine","Physical Architecture"]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"B.Arch"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Architectural Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Computational Thinking"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Computational Geometry"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Grasshopper"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Parametric Modelling"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Generative Design"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Optimization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Environmental Simulation"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"BIM / Revit"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Dynamo"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Rhino.Inside.Revit"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI / Machine Learning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Data Visualization"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Digital Fabrication"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Robotics"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Design Communication"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to build a complete computational workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Design Problem","Define Parameters","Build Computational Logic","Generate Geometry","Create Design Alternatives","Run Performance Analysis","Optimize","Select Best Solution","BIM Integration","Documentation","Fabrication / Construction"]},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, target:"},{"type":"h","text":"3–5 computational design projects"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"2+ serious Grasshopper projects"},{"text":"1 Python-based architecture project"},{"text":"1 environmental optimization project"},{"text":"1 BIM automation project"},{"text":"1 physical/digital fabrication project"},{"text":"At least one computational-design internship"},{"text":"The portfolio should show the logic behind the design, not just attractive renders."}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Arch","Computational Design","Grasshopper","Python","BIM","Generative Design","Optimization","Environmental Simulation","Digital Fabrication"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The biggest advantage is becoming a professional who can translate architectural problems into computational systems and turn those systems into measurable design solutions."},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal professional identity"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architect","Computational Designer","Design Technologist"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This creates strong pathways into parametric architecture, generative design, BIM automation, environmental optimization, digital fabrication, AI-assisted architecture, robotics, and AEC technology."}]}]}